e-action analysis: a pilot study</article-title><source>J Vasc Interv Radiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>483</fpage><lpage>488</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11997356</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1051-0443(07)61528-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>den Boer</surname><given-names>KT</given-names></name><name><surname>Straatsburg</surname><given-names>IH</given-names></name><name><surname>Schellinger</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>de Wit</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name><name><surname>Dankelman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gouma</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quantitative analysis of the functionality and efficiency of three surgical dissection techniques: a time-motion analysis</article-title><source>J Laparoendosc Adv Surg Tech A</source><year>1999</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>389</fpage><lpage>395</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10522532</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Minekus</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Rozing</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Valstar</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name><name><surname>Dankelman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evaluation of humeral head replacements using time-action analysis</article-title><source>J Shoulder Elbow Surg</source><year>2003</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>152</fpage><lpage>157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12700568</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1067/mse.2003.14</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sjoerdsma</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Meijer</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Jansen</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>den Boer</surname><given-names>KT</given-names></name><name><surname>Grimbergen</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of efficiencies of three techniques for colon surgery</article-title><source>J Laparoendosc Adv Surg Tech A</source><year>2000</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>47</fpage><lpage>53</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10706303</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pipino</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tissue-sparing surgery: 25 years' experience with femoral neck preserving hip arthroplasty</article-title><source>Journal of Orthopaedics and Traumatology</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>36</fpage><lpage>41</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10195-006-0120-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pipino</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Molfetta</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Grandizio</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Preservation of the femoral neck in hip arthroplasty: results of a 13-17-year follow-up</article-title><source>Journal of Orthopaedics and Traumatology</source><year>2000</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s101950070026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pipino</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CFP prosthetic stem in mini-invasive total hip arthroplasty</article-title><source>Journal of Orthopaedics and Traumatology</source><year>2004</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>165</fpage><lpage>171</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10195-004-0065-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Biggi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Franchin</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Lovato</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pipino</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>DEXA evaluation of total hip arthroplasty with neck-preserving technique: 4-year follow-up</article-title><source>Journal of Orthopaedics and Traumatology</source><year>2004</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>156</fpage><lpage>159</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10195-004-0063-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>de</surname><given-names>G</given-names><suffix>I</suffix></name><name><surname>Reijman</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Terwee</surname><given-names>CB</given-names></name><name><surname>Bierma-Zeinstra</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Favejee</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Verhaar</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Validation of the Dutch version of the Hip disability and Osteoarthritis Outcome Score</article-title><source>Osteoarthritis Cartilage</source><year>2007</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>104</fpage><lpage>109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16890460</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.joca.2006.06.014</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Archibeck</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>RE</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Learning curve for the two-incision total hip replacement</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2004</year><fpage>232</fpage><lpage>238</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15577493</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.blo.0000150272.75831.2f</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stanton</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hierarchical task analysis: developments, applications, and extensions</article-title><source>Appl Ergon</source><year>2006</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>55</fpage><lpage>79</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16139236</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.apergo.2005.06.003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sarker</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Hutchinson</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vincent</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Darzi</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Self-appraisal hierarchical task analysis of laparoscopic surgery performed by expert surgeons</article-title><source>Surg Endosc</source><year>2006</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>636</fpage><lpage>640</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16446987</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00464-005-0312-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rasmussen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Duncan</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Leplat</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>New technology and human error</source><year>1987</year><publisher-name>Chichester, New-York, Brisbane, Toronto, Singapore, John Wiley &#x00026; Sons</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The definition and measurement of acetabular orientation</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1993</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>228</fpage><lpage>232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8444942</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>